Some Events that happen annually in Old New Castle:

🕯️May 18 “A Day in Old New Castle” history reenactments & festivities!

🇺🇸June 7 & 8th “Separation Day” when DE declared independence from PA

🎄”The Spirit of Christmas” festival is held annually & feels like a real life Charles Dickens book.

👻During Halloween they have spooky ghost tours

 🍷Amstel Live! is a 21+ boozy museum party held at the Amstel House occasionally hosted by the historical society 

I absolutely adore Old New Castle and anytime I have out of state visitors, this is where I take them! 

Have you ever been to Old New Castle? What’s your favorite thing about it? 
